h time a Branch will appear in front of the tree, pick them all up."},{"x":33711,"y":31067,"z":9,"text":"4. Go to the south where there will be a Burn Out Bonfire , here . If it's not lit, use your torch on it and light it up, so it changes into a Smoldering Bonfire . Start using the wood on the bonfire."}],"href":"#/wiki/The%20Percht%20Queen"},{"creature":"The Sandking","qty":"1","hp":"Unknown.","exp":"200,000","loc":"Below the Dark Pyramid .","places":[{"name":"Dark Pyramid","x":33307,"y":32286,"z":7,"href":"#/wiki/Dark%20Pyramid"}],"href":"#/wiki/The%20Sandking"},{"creature":"Zushuka","qty":"1","hp":"15,000","exp":"9,000","loc":"Ice Witch Temple (bottom floor)","places":[{"name":"Ice Witch Temple","x":31923,"y":31360,"z":7,"href":"#/wiki/Ice%20Witch%20Temple"}],"href":"#/wiki/Zushuka"}]}}